  alt=\"Quote from JetBrains\"\n        src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-6__testimonial-jetbrains.width-100.format-webp_xEv9X02.webp\"\n        \n          loading=\"lazy\"\n          data-loading='{\n            \"mobile\": \"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-6__testimonial-jetbrains.width-500.format-webp_AZHsC2I.webp\",\n            \"desktop\": \"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-6__testimonial-jetbrain.width-1000.format-webp_lcfd9vt.webp\"\n          }'\n        \n      >\n    </div>\n  \n</uni-media>\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n</uni-media-carousel-slide>\n\n      \n    </uni-media-carousel-viewport>\n\n    <div slot=\"controls\">\n      <div class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls-container\">\n        <uni-carousel-controls class=\"uni-media-carousel__controls\"></uni-carousel-controls>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </uni-media-carousel>\n</section>\n  \n\n  \n    \n\n<section\n  class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\"\n  data-analytics-module='{\n    \"module_name\": \"Paragraph\",\n    \"section_header\": \"Introducing Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash\\u002DLite, and 3.5 Flash Cyber\"\n  }'>\n  <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\"><h2 data-block-key=\"q62nc\">Built with safety</h2><p data-block-key=\"1la1v\">3.6 Flash is shipping with enhanced <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/strengthening-our-frontier-safety-framework/\">Frontier Safety</a> safeguards in the domains of Chemical, Biological, Radiological, and Nuclear (CBRN) and cyber offense misuses. These safeguards make the model substantially more resistant to jailbreaks. At the same time, the model has been trained to minimize refusals for beneficial uses.</p><p data-block-key=\"2rrtc\">For more information, see the <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/models/model-cards/gemini-3-6-flash/\">3.6 Flash</a> model card.</p><h2 data-block-key=\"g9g3\">3.5 Flash-Lite: Built to scale agentic workflows</h2><p data-block-key=\"8hoj2\">Beyond Flash, we’re also releasing Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite, designed for both low-latency tasks and tasks where high throughput is critical for developers workflows, like agentic search and document processing.</p><p data-block-key=\"9tcrh\">3.5 Flash-Lite is the fastest model in the 3.5 series. As measured by <a href=\"https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/gemini-3-5-flash-lite\">Artificial Analysis</a>, it runs at 350 output tokens/s. Priced at $0.3/1M input tokens and $2.5/1M output tokens and with significantly better quality than 3.1 Flash-Lite, 3.5 Flash-Lite offers a strong price-to-performance ratio for developers and customers running high throughput production traffic.</p></div>\n  </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section>\n\n  \n\n  \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-catalog-id=\"reduce-motion-player\">\n  {\n    \"play_video\": \"Play video\",\n    \"pause_video\": \"Pause video\"\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-catalog-id=\"video-player\">\n  {\n    \"play_video\": \"Play video\",\n    \"pause_video\": \"Pause video\",\n    \"mute\": \"Click to mute audio\",\n    \"unmute\": \"Click to unmute audio\",\n    \"enable_cc\": \"Enable Closed captions\",\n    \"disable_cc\": \"Disable Closed captions\",\n    \"disable_ad\": \"Disable audio description\",\n    \"enable_ad\": \"Enable audio description\",\n    \"video_progress\": \"Video progress\",\n    \"aria_value_text\": \"elapsed time: [[elapsedTime]], total time: [[totalTime]]\"\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n  <uni-inline-image\n    class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\"\n    alignment=\"full\"\n    alt-text=\"3.5 Flash-Lite executes high volume tasks at a lower latency than 3.5 Flash.\"\n    external-image=\"\"\n    or-mp4-video-title=\"3.5 Flash-Lite vs. 3.5 Flash latency SxS (API)\"\n    or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/modelComparator-35FL-vs-3.5F-260720c.mp4\"\n    section-header=\"Introducing Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash-Lite, and 3.5 Flash Cyber\"\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      autoplay=\"true\"\n    \n  >\n    \n      <div slot=\"caption-slot\">\n        <div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"9gg63\">3.5 Flash-Lite executes high volume tasks at a lower latency than 3.5 Flash.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    \n\n    \n  </uni-inline-image>\n</section>\n\n  \n\n  \n    \n\n<section\n  class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\"\n  data-analytics-module='{\n    \"module_name\": \"Paragraph\",\n    \"section_header\": \"Introducing Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash\\u002DLite, and 3.5 Flash Cyber\"\n  }'>\n  <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"q62nc\">3.5 Flash-Lite enables efficient scaling for agentic systems. Across thinking levels, the model significantly outperforms 3.1 Flash-Lite. Depending on the workload, developers can configure the model to prioritize low-latency, low-cost execution for high-volume tasks with the minimal and low thinking levels, or engage higher thinking levels to process multi-step subagent workloads. The model now also has computer use as a built-in tool to reliably support these agentic tasks across surfaces.</p><p data-block-key=\"12nlh\">It’s a significant step up in coding and agentic tasks as seen in Terminal-Bench 2.1 (54% vs 31%), long context as seen in GDM-MRCR v2 (72.2% vs. 60.1%), and real-world task execution as seen in GDPval-AA v2 (1140 vs. 642).</p></div>\n  </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section>\n\n  \n\n  \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-catalog-id=\"reduce-motion-player\">\n  {\n    \"play_video\": \"Play video\",\n    \"pause_video\": \"Pause video\"\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-catalog-id=\"video-player\">\n  {\n    \"play_video\": \"Play video\",\n    \"pause_video\": \"Pause video\",\n    \"mute\": \"Click to mute audio\",\n    \"unmute\": \"Click to unmute audio\",\n    \"enable_cc\": \"Enable Closed captions\",\n    \"disable_cc\": \"Disable Closed captions\",\n    \"disable_ad\": \"Disable audio description\",\n    \"enable_ad\": \"Enable audio description\",\n    \"video_progress\": \"Video progress\",\n    \"aria_value_text\": \"elapsed time: [[elapsedTime]], total time: [[totalTime]]\"\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n  <uni-inline-image\n    class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\"\n    alignment=\"full\"\n    alt-text=\"chart\"\n    external-image=\"\"\n    or-mp4-video-title=\"\"\n    or-mp4-video-url=\"\"\n    section-header=\"Introducing Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash-Lite, and 3.5 Flash Cyber\"\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      autoplay=\"true\"\n    \n  >\n    \n\n    \n      <div slot=\"image-slot\">\n        <img\n          alt=\"chart\"\n          src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-5-flash-lite__evals__co.width-1200.format-webp.webp\"\n          \n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 80vw, 1200px\"\n            srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-5-flash-lite__evals__com.width-500.format-webp.webp 500w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-5-flash-lite__evals__com.width-800.format-webp.webp 800w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-5-flash-lite__evals__co.width-1200.format-webp.webp 1200w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-5-flash-lite__evals__co.width-1600.format-webp.webp 1600w, https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/gemini-3-5-flash-lite__evals__co.width-2000.format-webp.webp 2000w\"\n          \n        >\n      </div>\n    \n  </uni-inline-image>\n</section>\n\n  \n\n  \n    \n\n<section\n  class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\"\n  data-analytics-module='{\n    \"module_name\": \"Paragraph\",\n    \"section_header\": \"Introducing Gemini 3.6 Flash, 3.5 Flash\\u002DLite, and 3.5 Flash Cyber\"\n  }'>\n  <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"q62nc\">In fact, on many agentic and coding evals, 3.5 Flash-Lite even outperforms 3 Flash, including on SWE-Bench Pro (54.2% vs. 49.6%) and OSWorld-Verified (74.0% vs. 65.1%), making it a faster &amp; more capable option for workloads on both 2.5 and 3 Flash.</p></div>\n  </uni-article-paragraph>\n</section>\n\n  \n\n  \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-catalog-id=\"reduce-motion-player\">\n  {\n    \"play_video\": \"Play video\",\n    \"pause_video\": \"Pause video\"\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-catalog-id=\"video-player\">\n  {\n    \"play_video\": \"Play video\",\n    \"pause_video\": \"Pause video\",\n    \"mute\": \"Click to mute audio\",\n    \"unmute\": \"Click to unmute audio\",\n    \"enable_cc\": \"Enable Closed captions\",\n    \"disable_cc\": \"Disable Closed captions\",\n    \"disable_ad\": \"Disable audio description\",\n    \"enable_ad\": \"Enable audio description\",\n    \"video_progress\": \"Video progress\",\n    \"aria_value_text\": \"elapsed time: [[elapsedTime]], total time: [[totalTime]]\"\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n  <uni-inline-image\n    class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\"\